{"path":"thread/jthread/detach","title":"std::jthread::detach","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::jthread::</span>detach","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/jthread/detach","section":"thread","kind":"page","summary":"Separates the thread of execution from the jthread object, allowing execution to continue independently. Any allocated resources will be freed once the thread exits.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> detach<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Separates the thread of execution from the jthread object, allowing execution to continue independently. Any allocated resources will be freed once the thread exits.\n</p><p>After calling <code>detach</code> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> no longer owns any thread.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Postconditions\">Postconditions</h3>\n<p><span class=\"t-lc\">joinable</span> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p><span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/system_error\">std::system_error</a></span> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">joinable<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> or an error occurs.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;chrono&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;thread&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> independentThread<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> \n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Starting concurrent thread.<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/sleep_for\"><span class=\"kw2170\">std::<span class=\"me2\">this_thread</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">sleep_for</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw1001\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">seconds</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Exiting concurrent thread.<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> threadCaller<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> \n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Starting thread caller.<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/jthread\"><span class=\"kw3258\">std::<span class=\"me2\">jthread</span></span></a> t<span class=\"br0\">(</span>independentThread<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    t.<span class=\"me1\">detach</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/sleep_for\"><span class=\"kw2170\">std::<span class=\"me2\">this_thread</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">sleep_for</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw1001\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">seconds</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Exiting thread caller.<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> \n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    threadCaller<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/sleep_for\"><span class=\"kw2170\">std::<span class=\"me2\">this_thread</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">sleep_for</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw1001\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">seconds</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">5</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Starting thread caller.\nStarting concurrent thread.\nExiting thread caller.\nExiting concurrent thread.</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"References\">References</h3>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-c++23\">\n<ul><li> C++23 standard (ISO/IEC 14882:2024): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 33.4.4.3 Members [thread.jthread.mem] \n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-c++20\">\n<ul><li> C++20 standard (ISO/IEC 14882:2020): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 32.4.3.2 Members [thread.jthread.mem] \n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/jthread/join\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>join</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  waits for the thread to finish its execution <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/jthread/joinable\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>joinable</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  checks whether the thread is joinable, i.e. potentially running in parallel context <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/thread/thrd_detach\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>thrd_detach</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Postconditions","id":"Postconditions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"References","id":"References"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"thread","title":"Concurrency support library (since C++11)"},{"path":"thread/jthread","title":"std::jthread"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::jthread::detach","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++20. Separates the thread of execution from the jthread object, allowing execution to continue independently."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Postconditions","note":"joinable is false."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"std::system_error if joinable() == false or an error occurs."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"join","note":"waits for the thread to finish its execution"},{"label":"joinable","note":"checks whether the thread is joinable, i.e. potentially running in parallel context"}]}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":165,"codeBlockCount":2}
